T03:52:18Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"8f7070486cca733f15e4e57e96ab64e12059fb79","github_link":"https://github.com/karatelabs/karate/commit/8f7070486cca733f15e4e57e96ab64e12059fb79","commit_subject":"karate-core: karate run applied karate-pom.json twice — KaratePom.applyTo added the pom's paths and listeners to the builder, then the CLI's own field-by-field merge added the resolved values again; path() and listenerFactory() accumulate, so every pom path ran twice (features: 2 for one file) and a pom listener fired twice, in every run that loaded a pom, including with a positional path or -P. RunCommand now merges once in a package-private toBuilder(): CLI over pom for every field, with the pom's output formats as the fallback applyTo used to supply, and a CLI path replaces the pom paths as CLI.md says. RunCommandTest builds the suite from a pom and asserts one feature and one listener, and that a CLI path wins over the pom's — both fail with applyTo re-inserted. CLI.md spells out that positional/-P paths replace pom paths.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"nerds-odd-e/doughnut","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:52:02Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"bdb0f999b86606bd4802b4e8a318833429baaa1b","github_link":"https://github.com/nerds-odd-e/doughnut/commit/bdb0f999b86606bd4802b4e8a318833429baaa1b","commit_subject":"Wrap up story 41: remove spent plan and seed history (plan 130)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ever-co/ever-gauzy","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:50:37Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"5a0d26b6e8983e974cefce445f64cc462b01acf7","github_link":"https://github.com/ever-co/ever-gauzy/commit/5a0d26b6e8983e974cefce445f64cc462b01acf7","commit_subject":"fix(security): release the /invite/contact claim when the invite is refused before provisioning","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ever-co/ever-gauzy","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:49:43Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"70b1a856064b3a73a0cbd162aa372fc4b7999fb9","github_link":"https://github.com/ever-co